{
  "name": "Kualat: Short link form",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Short link form\n\nA small web form hosted by n8n: paste a long URL, submit, and the completion page shows the fresh kua.lat short link. Share the form URL with teammates so anyone can shorten links without touching the kua.lat dashboard.\n\n**Set up:**\n1. Install the **@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat** community node under Settings → Community Nodes.\n2. Create a **Kualat API** credential (API URL, for example `https://kua.lat/api`, and an API key).\n3. Open the form once with **Execute workflow** and use the Test URL to try it.\n4. Activate the workflow and share the Production URL of the form trigger.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "f0a00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "shorten-link",
        "formTitle": "Create a short link",
        "formDescription": "Paste a long URL and get a kua.lat short link back.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Destination URL",
              "placeholder": "https://example.com/very/long/page",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Custom alias (optional)",
              "placeholder": "spring-sale",
              "requiredField": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0a00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "On form submission",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "f0a00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "link",
        "operation": "create",
        "url": "={{ $json['Destination URL'] }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "custom": "={{ $json['Custom alias (optional)'] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "f0a00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Create Link",
      "type": "@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat.kualat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "respondWith": "text",
        "completionTitle": "Your short link is ready",
        "completionMessage": "=🔗 {{ $json.short_url }}\n\nDestination: {{ $json.long_url }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0a00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Show Short Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "On form submission": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Show Short Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
